`bcc89a5aa7d8067dda98374393444eb885a4283a41fd33e323496380e057e1a6`.

See [NOTICE-FI2010.md](NOTICE-FI2010.md) for attribution and
[reports/fi2010_data_handoff.md](reports/fi2010_data_handoff.md) for provenance controls.

## Limitations

FI-2010 does not expose the unnormalised prices, precise timestamps, instrument identities, venue/feed
mechanics or reliable instrument/day boundaries needed for an execution-quality backtest. Sequence
windows are also intentionally excluded because the released matrices do not provide trustworthy
boundaries for constructing them without cross-boundary contamination.

The project should therefore be read as a **rigorous short-horizon LOB signal research system**, not
as a claim of a deployable or profitable trading strategy.

For the exact recruiter-publication sequence after a real v0.6 run, see [docs/publishing.md](docs/publishing.md).
